{"seq":2,"slug":"routing-types","title":"direct/fanout/topic/headers 路由","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rabbitmq-messaging-ops/amqp-model/routing-types","wordCount":1886,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"direct-fanout-topic-headers-路由\">direct/fanout/topic/headers 路由</h1><p>交换器类型不是风格偏好，而是一套匹配算法。选错类型的代价通常在半年后才显现：日志量涨到需要按服务拆队列时，你会发现当初用 fanout 广播的事件里没有任何可切分的维度；想按地域做过滤时，route key 里从来没写过地域字段。<strong>路由键一旦开始被消费，改它的成本等于一次跨团队的数据迁移</strong>。这一篇把四种类型的匹配算法摊开，目的不是让你记住语法，而是让你在设计第一个绑定键时就知道它未来能承载多少种查询。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>四种交换器类型唯一的差别就是<strong>用什么去匹配绑定</strong>。其余一切——声明、绑定、发布、确认——都是同一套协议。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交换器类型</th>\n<th>匹配依据</th>\n<th>匹配算法复杂度</th>\n<th>无匹配时的默认行为</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>direct</code></td>\n<td>路由键字符串全等</td>\n<td>哈希查找 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>丢弃（除非 mandatory 或备用交换器）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fanout</code></td>\n<td>不匹配，全部投递</td>\n<td>遍历绑定表 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>topic</code></td>\n<td>路由键按 <code>.</code> 分词后匹配模式</td>\n<td>词级前缀树 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mtext>词数</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\text{词数})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">词数</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>headers</code></td>\n<td>消息头属性值逐项比较</td>\n<td>逐头比较 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(m \\cdot k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>丢弃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"direct-精确匹配与多队列扇出\">direct：精确匹配与多队列扇出</h2><p>direct 交换器的匹配规则只有一条：<strong>消息的路由键与绑定的 <code>routing_key</code> 字符串完全相等时投递</strong>。没有前缀、没有大小写折叠、没有正则。它最简单也最容易被低估——实际上 direct 已经能覆盖大部分&quot;按任务类型分发&quot;的场景。</p>\n<p>真正的灵活性来自&quot;一个路由键绑定到多个队列&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"channel.exchange_declare(exchange=&quot;tasks&quot;, exchange_type=&quot;direct&quot;, durable=True)&#10;channel.queue_declare(queue=&quot;tasks.high&quot;)&#10;channel.queue_declare(queue=&quot;tasks.low&quot;)&#10;&#10;channel.queue_bind(&quot;tasks.high&quot;, &quot;tasks&quot;, routing_key=&quot;critical&quot;)&#10;channel.queue_bind(&quot;tasks.low&quot;,  &quot;tasks&quot;, routing_key=&quot;normal&quot;)&#10;channel.queue_bind(&quot;tasks.low&quot;,  &quot;tasks&quot;, routing_key=&quot;critical&quot;)&#10;&#10;channel.basic_publish(&quot;tasks&quot;, &quot;critical&quot;, b&quot;batch job&quot;)   # 同时进入两个队列\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.exchange_declare(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">exchange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">exchange_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"direct\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">durable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.queue_declare(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks.high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.queue_declare(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">queue</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks.low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.queue_bind(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks.high\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">routing_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.queue_bind(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks.low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">routing_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"normal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.queue_bind(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks.low\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,  </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">routing_key</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.basic_publish(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tasks\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"critical\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">b</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"batch job\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 同时进入两个队列</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第三条绑定让 <code>critical</code> 这个消息同时进入高优与低优队列——同一个路由键，两个消费者群体，各自独立消费。这是&quot;扇出&quot;的最小实现，不需要 fanout 交换器。代价是消息在 broker 里存了两份，容量估算要按扇出倍数放大。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交换器类型</th>\n<th>匹配依据</th>\n<th>一个路由键命中几个队列</th>\n<th>运行期改路由的成本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>direct</code></td>\n<td>路由键全等</td>\n<td>0 到 N（取决于绑定数）</td>\n<td>低：加绑定即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>fanout</code></td>\n<td>忽略路由键</td>\n<td>所有绑定队列</td>\n<td>中：只能整体加/减队列</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>topic</code></td>\n<td>通配符模式匹配</td>\n<td>0 到 N（可叠加）</td>\n<td>低：加模式即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>headers</code></td>\n<td>消息头属性匹配</td>\n<td>0 到 N</td>\n<td>中：需改生产者属性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"fanout-广播与它隐藏的容量问题\">fanout：广播与它隐藏的容量问题</h2><p>fanout 交换器<strong>完全忽略路由键</strong>，把消息复制给所有绑定的目标。它的正确用法是&quot;所有订阅者都必须收到同一份事件&quot;，比如配置变更通知、缓存失效广播。错误用法是把它当作&quot;省事的发布订阅&quot;——当订阅者数量从 3 涨到 30，每次发布就变成 30 次写入，而这个扇出倍数在任何单点监控指标上都不明显。</p>\n<p>fanout 与 direct 有一个容易被忽视的差异：<strong>fanout 的绑定不需要路由键</strong>。这意味着你也可以用 direct 交换器加一个固定路由键模拟 fanout，但那样每加一个队列都要改一次绑定键（绑错就静默收不到），fanout 的语义更直白。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    P[生产者] --&gt;|&quot;rk: anything&quot;| EX{fanout 交换器}&#10;    EX --&gt; Q1[(队列 1&lt;br/&gt;必须收到)]&#10;    EX --&gt; Q2[(队列 2&lt;br/&gt;必须收到)]&#10;    EX --&gt; Q3[(队列 3&lt;br/&gt;必须收到)]&#10;    Q1 --&gt; C1[消费者 1]&#10;    Q2 --&gt; C2[消费者 2]&#10;    EX -.-&gt;|无绑定| X[消息被丢弃&lt;br/&gt;除非配置了 alternate exchange]\">graph TD\n    P[生产者] --&gt;|\"rk: anything\"| EX{fanout 交换器}\n    EX --&gt; Q1[(队列 1&lt;br/&gt;必须收到)]\n    EX --&gt; Q2[(队列 2&lt;br/&gt;必须收到)]\n    EX --&gt; Q3[(队列 3&lt;br/&gt;必须收到)]\n    Q1 --&gt; C1[消费者 1]\n    Q2 --&gt; C2[消费者 2]\n    EX -.-&gt;|无绑定| X[消息被丢弃&lt;br/&gt;除非配置了 alternate exchange]</pre><p>图中最后一条虚线是 fanout 最危险的情形：<strong>没有任何绑定时，消息直接消失，且发布方不会收到任何错误</strong>。解决方案是给交换器配置备用交换器（alternate exchange），不可路由的消息会被转发过去而不是丢弃（来源：RabbitMQ 官方 Exchanges 文档「allows an exchange that was unable to route a message because there were no suitable bindings … to delegate routing to a different exchange」，<a href=\"https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/exchanges）。这个配置在\">https://www.rabbitmq.com/docs/exchanges）。这个配置在</a> <a href=\"messages-properties\">消息属性、TTL 与死信交换</a> 里与死信链一并讨论。</p>\n<h2 id=\"topic-通配符匹配与绑定键设计\">topic：通配符匹配与绑定键设计</h2><p>topic 交换器的路由键是以 <code>.</code> 分隔的词序列，绑定键支持两个通配符：<code>*</code> 匹配<strong>恰好一个</strong>词，<code>#</code> 匹配<strong>零个或多个</strong>词。匹配是词级别的，<code>order*</code> 这样的部分词通配是不合法的——<code>*</code> 必须独占一个词的位置。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"路由键：order.paid.cn&#10;绑定 order.*.cn        → 匹配（* 吃掉 paid）&#10;绑定 order.#           → 匹配（# 吃掉 paid.cn）&#10;绑定 order.*           → 不匹配（* 只能吃一个词，cn 无人吃）&#10;绑定 #                 → 匹配（等价于 fanout 的效果）&#10;绑定 *.*.*             → 匹配（三个词，三个星）&#10;绑定 order.paid.cn.extra → 不匹配（绑定键比路由键长）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>路由键：order.paid.cn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>绑定 order.*.cn        → 匹配（* 吃掉 paid）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>绑定 order.#           → 匹配（# 吃掉 paid.cn）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>绑定 order.*           → 不匹配（* 只能吃一个词，cn 无人吃）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>绑定 #                 → 匹配（等价于 fanout 的效果）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>绑定 *.*.*             → 匹配（三个词，三个星）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>绑定 order.paid.cn.extra → 不匹配（绑定键比路由键长）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这套规则的实践价值在于<strong>层次化命名</strong>。一个被广泛验证的绑定键设计是把维度从粗到细排列，把最常用的过滤维度放在最左边：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 事件命名：&lt;domain&gt;.&lt;entity&gt;.&lt;action&gt;.&lt;region&gt;&#10;rabbitmqadmin declare binding source=events destination=svc-billing \\&#10;  routing_key=&quot;order.invoice.#&quot;&#10;rabbitmqadmin declare binding source=events destination=svc-audit \\&#10;  routing_key=&quot;#.deleted.#&quot;&#10;rabbitmqadmin declare binding source=events destination=svc-cn \\&#10;  routing_key=&quot;#.cn&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 事件命名：&#x3C;domain>.&#x3C;entity>.&#x3C;action>.&#x3C;region></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rabbitmqadmin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> declare</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> binding</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> source=events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> destination=svc-billing</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  routing_key=\"order.invoice.#\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rabbitmqadmin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> declare</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> binding</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> source=events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> destination=svc-audit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  routing_key=\"#.deleted.#\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rabbitmqadmin</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> declare</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> binding</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> source=events</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> destination=svc-cn</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> \\</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">  routing_key=\"#.cn\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>第二条绑定 <code>#.deleted.#</code> 说明一个容易踩的坑：<strong><code>#</code> 可以出现在开头和中间</strong>，所以&quot;所有删除事件&quot;这样跨域的模式是可行的。但这类宽泛绑定会随事件种类增长而不断放大流量——每次新增一个业务域，这条绑定的匹配量就增加一份，而它的消费者可能根本没准备好。生产中应当限制 <code>#</code> 开头的绑定数量，并在监控里单独盯住这些队列的入队速率。</p>\n<p>第三种陷阱是 <strong><code>#</code> 与 <code>*</code> 的语义不对等</strong>：<code>order.#</code> 匹配 <code>order</code>（零个词），而 <code>order.*</code> 不匹配。这个差异在做&quot;先发粗粒度事件、后续细化&quot;的演进时会咬人——旧的 <code>order.#</code> 订阅者会收到比预期更多的东西。</p>\n<h2 id=\"headers-属性匹配与它的现实处境\">headers：属性匹配与它的现实处境</h2><p>headers 交换器不看路由键，而是比较消息的 <code>headers</code> 表与绑定的 <code>arguments</code>。绑定参数中 <code>x-match</code> 决定比较方式：<code>all</code>（默认）要求所有指定头都匹配，<code>any</code> 要求任意一个匹配。以 <code>x-</code> 开头的头名是保留的，不参与匹配（来源：RabbitMQ 官方 AMQP Concepts 教程「For &quot;any&quot; and &quot;all&quot;, headers beginning with the string <code>x-</code> will not be used to evaluate matches」，并说明 <code>any-with-x</code> / <code>all-with-x</code> 才会纳入，<a href=\"https://www.rabbitmq.com/tutorials/amqp-concepts）。\">https://www.rabbitmq.com/tutorials/amqp-concepts）。</a></p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"channel.exchange_declare(exchange=&quot;fmt&quot;, exchange_type=&quot;headers&quot;)&#10;channel.queue_bind(&quot;docs&quot;, &quot;fmt&quot;, arguments={&#10;    &quot;x-match&quot;: &quot;all&quot;,&#10;    &quot;format&quot;: &quot;pdf&quot;,&#10;    &quot;version&quot;: 3,          # 数字类型也要精确匹配&#10;})&#10;channel.basic_publish(&quot;fmt&quot;, &quot;&quot;, body, properties=pika.BasicProperties(&#10;    headers={&quot;format&quot;: &quot;pdf&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: 3, &quot;author&quot;: &quot;ops&quot;},&#10;))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.exchange_declare(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">exchange</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fmt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">exchange_type</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"headers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.queue_bind(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"docs\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fmt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">arguments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"x-match\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"all\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 数字类型也要精确匹配</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">channel.basic_publish(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"fmt\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, body, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">properties</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">pika.BasicProperties(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    headers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"format\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"pdf\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"version\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"author\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ops\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>headers 的匹配对<strong>类型敏感</strong>：字符串 <code>&quot;3&quot;</code> 与整数 <code>3</code> 不相等。这在跨语言系统里是个实打实的坑——Go 客户端与 Python 客户端对同一个数值可能给出不同的 AMQP 字段类型编码，绑定突然失效而没有任何报错。</p>\n<p>尽管能力独特，headers 交换器在实践中使用率很低，原因有三：<strong>性能低于 topic</strong>（需要逐条消息解析属性表并逐头比较，而非字符串前缀匹配）；<strong>可观测性差</strong>（管理界面里绑定的显示不直观，排查时看不到&quot;为什么没匹配上&quot;）；<strong>没有客户端侧的统一校验</strong>。它的合理场景是需要按非层次化、非字符串属性（如数值区间之外的多维标签）路由，且吞吐要求不高。绝大多数&quot;想用 headers&quot;的需求都可以用 topic 加一个合成的路由键实现，后者更快也更易调试。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>direct 靠全等匹配，灵活性来自&quot;一个路由键绑多个队列&quot;</strong>，这已经覆盖大部分按任务类型分发的场景。</li>\n<li><strong>fanout 忽略路由键，所有绑定队列必收</strong>；它同时也是最容易无声丢消息的类型——没有绑定就等于丢弃，务必配置备用交换器。</li>\n<li><strong>topic 的通配符是词级别的</strong>：<code>*</code> 吃一个词、<code>#</code> 吃零或多个词；<code>order.#</code> 匹配 <code>order</code> 而 <code>order.*</code> 不匹配。</li>\n<li><strong>绑定键的维度顺序应按过滤频率排列</strong>，把最常用的维度放左边，这样宽泛绑定（<code>#</code> 开头）才不会失控。</li>\n<li><strong>headers 类型对属性类型敏感</strong>，跨语言系统里字符串与整数不相等；除非确有非层次化多维匹配需求，否则用 topic 替代。</li>\n<li>不可路由消息如何被兜住，见 <a href=\"messages-properties\">消息属性、TTL 与死信交换</a>；交换器与绑定的声明语义，见 <a href=\"exchange-binding-queue\">交换器、绑定与队列模型</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"direct/fanout/topic/headers 路由","id":"direct-fanout-topic-headers-路由"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"direct：精确匹配与多队列扇出","id":"direct-精确匹配与多队列扇出"},{"level":2,"text":"fanout：广播与它隐藏的容量问题","id":"fanout-广播与它隐藏的容量问题"},{"level":2,"text":"topic：通配符匹配与绑定键设计","id":"topic-通配符匹配与绑定键设计"},{"level":2,"text":"headers：属性匹配与它的现实处境","id":"headers-属性匹配与它的现实处境"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"交换器、绑定与队列模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rabbitmq-messaging-ops/amqp-model/exchange-binding-queue"},"next":{"title":"消息属性、TTL 与死信交换","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rabbitmq-messaging-ops/amqp-model/messages-properties"}}